OL,3,ADolly Parton's dad couldn't read - it
OL,4,Ainspired her to send books to millions
OL,5,Aof children
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne child in Denver called her "The
OL,8,FBook Queen".
OL,10,FAnother in Alabama calls her "Ms
OL,11,FDolly".
OL,13,FAcross the globe in Australia, a
OL,14,Ftoddler with speech delays delighted
OL,15,Fher family with her first word -
OL,16,F"orange" - after she and her twin
OL,17,Fsister received a free book in the post
OL,18,Fabout colours. It came from Imagination
OL,19,FLibrary, the literacy programme begun
OL,20,Fby late global superstar Dolly Parton.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
