OL,3,ADolly Parton's dad couldn't read - it
OL,4,Ainspired her to send books to millions
OL,5,Aof children
OL,6,
OL,7,FParton, who died this week aged 80,
OL,8,Flaunched the philanthropic effort in
OL,9,F1995 to honour her father - whose
OL,10,Fdifficult Appalachian upbringing never
OL,11,Fallowed him to finish school or learn
OL,12,Fto read and write.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
