OL,3,ACharli XCX electrifies Reading Festival
OL,4,Awith era-spanning set
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharli XCX has ushered in her next era
OL,7,Fwith an electrifying headline set at
OL,8,FReading Festival which showcased hits
OL,9,Ffrom across her music career.
OL,11,FIt marked the British singer's first UK
OL,12,Ffestival performance since releasing
OL,13,Fher latest studio album - Music,
OL,14,FFashion, Film - which is a pivot from
OL,15,Fher culture-shaping, electronic-pop
OL,16,Frecord Brat and features more of a rock
OL,17,Fedge.
OL,19,FBut her Friday evening show highlighted
OL,20,Fthe best of both, alongside fan
OL,21,Ffavourite tracks from her back
OL,22,Fcatalogue.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
